# Without this file the Vercel CLI falls back to .gitignore, which excludes
# src/config/*.json. Those are generated, not authored, but they are genuine
# build inputs: the app cannot resolve a single address without them, and the
# files they are generated from (devnet.json at the repo root, and the IDL
# under target/) are not inside this directory and so are never uploaded when
# app/ is the deploy root.
#
# So the generated copies are what ship. Only real build output is excluded.
node_modules
.next
out
